    "body": "Fixes #259\r\n\r\nIssue #259 caused a Gloo collective mismatch when DCP async checkpoint saving shared the default Gloo process group with StageTimers CPU all_gather.\r\n\r\nThis change:\r\n- creates a dedicated Gloo process group for stage timing;\r\n- routes StageTimers all_gather through that group;\r\n- preserves the default process group for DCP async save;\r\n- destroys the timing group before the default process group.\r\n\r\nValidation:\r\n- CPU/Gloo regression tests passed: 9 passed;\r\n- real 8-GPU Pi05 FSDP run completed 30/30 steps with --save-format dcp --async-save;\r\n- async and synchronous DCP checkpoints both resumed successfully from step 20 to step 30;\r\n- resumed loss maximum relative difference was 0.182265%;\r\n- checkpoints contained resume_meta.json and 8 DCP shards.\r\n<img width=\"2720\" height=\"1820\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abe8cf5f-5bb0-40e2-aad7-49d641cc1d77\" />\r\n",
